<% content_for :title, "Support — Show Notes" %>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
  <article class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Support</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">How to get help with Show Notes.</p>

    <p>Show Notes is built and operated by Dave Paola. There is no support team, no AI chatbot, no ticketing system. Every email is read and answered by a human, usually within a day.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Email</h2>

    <p>For anything — bug reports, feature requests, account questions, billing, privacy, or just to say hi:</p>

    <p><a href="mailto:dpaola2@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline text-lg font-medium">dpaola2@gmail.com</a></p>

    <p>When reporting a bug, please include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>What you were trying to do</li>
      <li>What happened instead</li>
      <li>Your platform (iOS app, web, or both) and version if known</li>
      <li>A screenshot, if there's something visual</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Account deletion</h2>

    <p>To delete your account and all associated data, email <a href="mailto:dpaola2@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">dpaola2@gmail.com</a> from the address you signed up with. We'll permanently delete your account, podcast subscriptions, library, and any associated data within 30 days. In-app account deletion is coming to the iOS and web apps in a future release.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Privacy questions</h2>

    <p>See the <%= link_to "privacy policy", privacy_path, class: "text-blue-600 hover:underline" %> for a full description of what we collect and why. For specific privacy requests (data access, data export, deletion), email <a href="mailto:dpaola2@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">dpaola2@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Status</h2>

    <p>If the site or app seems broken, it might be on us. Email <a href="mailto:dpaola2@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">dpaola2@gmail.com</a> and we'll get back to you with what's happening.</p>
  </article>
</div>
